Article 5 In addition to the individuals and organizations included in the countermeasure list pursuant to Article 4 of this Law, the relevant departments of the State Council may also decide to take countermeasures against the following individuals and organizations:
(1) the spouse and direct relatives of the individual included in the countermeasure list;
(2) the senior officer or actual controller of the organization included in the countermeasure list;
(3) the organization in which the individual included in the countermeasure list serves as a senior officer; and
(4) the organization actually controlled by, or in whose establishment or operation the individual or organization included in the countermeasure list participates.

Article 6 The relevant departments of the State Council may, in accordance with their respective functions and division of tasks, decide to take one or several of the following measures against the individuals and organizations specified in Articles 4 and 5 of this Law, depending on the actual circumstances:
(1) not issuing a visa, denying entry, canceling a visa, or expelling them from the country;
(2) sealing, seizing, or freezing movable property, immovable property, and other types of property within China;
(3) prohibiting or restricting transactions, cooperation, or other activities between organizations and individuals within China and the aforementioned individuals or organizations; and
(4) other necessary measures.
